			<div class="content" id="post-content-4044746">
									

<p>Head to the Joke list, and see if there's another number or designation you'd prefer over 4126. You might want a rounder number, such as 4050-J, or something non-standard, like SCP-BOO-J. Just make sure whatever you want isn't already in use.</p>
<p>You can then either:</p>
<p>Simply change the url of this page, (bottom of the page under Options, look for &quot;Rename&quot;). You'd want to either append -J to the url, or chenge the designation entirely. Following this, edit the Joke page to include your entry following the format of the rest of the list.</p>
<p>Alternatively, delete this page, and repost under the new url. I am not on rewrite staff, but I feel that it is enough of a contextual change to merit a repost without actually rewriting the content. If you choose the deletion route, I would first follow up with a member of our rewrite team just to make sure it is a sufficient change to merit a repost. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129691&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1540916224" alt="Modern_Erasmus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129691)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/modern-erasmus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3129691); return false;">Modern_Erasmus</a></span> is pretty active and should be able to assist with that query.</p>

